function FileTool({tool,onCopy}:{tool:Tool;onCopy:(x:string)=>void}){const[files,setFiles]=useState<File[]>([]);const[busy,setBusy]=useState(false);const[msg,setMsg]=useState('');const[preview,setPreview]=useState('');const handle=async()=>{if(!files.length)return;setBusy(true);try{if(tool.type==='qr'){const canvas=document.createElement('canvas');await QRCode.toCanvas(canvas,preview||'https://toolora.app');const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=canvas.toDataURL('image/png');a.download='toolora-qr.png';a.click();setMsg('QR code generated locally.')}else if(tool.type==='zip'){if(tool.id==='zip-creator'){const z=new JSZip();for(const f of files)z.file(f.name,await f.arrayBuffer());const blob=await z.generateAsync({type:'blob'});download(blob,'toolora-files.zip');setMsg('ZIP created locally.')}else{const z=await JSZip.loadAsync(await files[0].arrayBuffer());const names=Object.keys(z.files);setMsg(`Archive contains ${names.length} file(s): ${names.slice(0,8).join(', ')}`)}}else if(tool.type==='image'||tool.type==='imageconvert'||tool.type==='imagepdf'||tool.type==='imageinfo'){const f=files[0];const url=URL.createObjectURL(f);if(tool.type==='imageinfo'){const im=new Image();im.onload=()=>{setMsg(`${f.name} · ${im.naturalWidth}×${im.naturalHeight} · ${(f.size/1024).toFixed(1)} KB`);URL.revokeObjectURL(url)};im.src=url}else if(tool.id==='image-to-pdf'||tool.type==='imagepdf'){const im=new Image();im.onload=async()=>{const pdf=await PDFDocument.create();const page=pdf.addPage([im.naturalWidth,im.naturalHeight]);const bytes=await fetch(url).then(r=>r.arrayBuffer());const img=f.type==='image/png'?await pdf.embedPng(bytes):await pdf.embedJpg(bytes);page.drawImage(img,{x:0,y:0,width:im.naturalWidth,height:im.naturalHeight});download(new Blob([await pdf.save()],{type:'application/pdf'}),'toolora-image.pdf');setMsg('PDF created locally.');URL.revokeObjectURL(url)};im.src=url}else{const im=new Image();im.onload=()=>{const canvas=document.createElement('canvas');let w=im.naturalWidth,h=im.naturalHeight;const max=tool.id.includes('social')?1080:1600;if(w>max){h=Math.round(h*max/w);w=max}canvas.width=w;canvas.height=h;canvas.getContext('2d')!.drawImage(im,0,0,w,h);const mime=tool.id.includes('png')||tool.id==='favicon-generator'?'image/png':tool.id.includes('webp')?'image/webp':'image/jpeg';canvas.toBlob(b=>{if(b){download(b,tool.id+'-'+f.name.replace(/\.[^.]+$/,'')+'.'+mime.split('/')[1]);setMsg(`Processed locally: ${(b.size/1024).toFixed(1)} KB`)}},mime,Number(.8));URL.revokeObjectURL(url)};im.src=url}}else if(tool.type==='pdf'){const pdf=await PDFDocument.load(await files[0].arrayBuffer());if(tool.id==='pdf-merge'){const out=await PDFDocument.create();for(const f of files){const src=await PDFDocument.load(await f.arrayBuffer());const pages=await out.copyPages(src,src.getPageIndices());pages.forEach(p=>out.addPage(p))}download(new Blob([await out.save()],{type:'application/pdf'}),'toolora-merged.pdf');setMsg('PDFs merged locally.')}else if(tool.id==='pdf-split'){const out=await PDFDocument.create();const [p]=await out.copyPages(pdf,[0]);out.addPage(p);download(new Blob([await out.save()],{type:'application/pdf'}),'toolora-split.pdf');setMsg('First page extracted locally.')}else{download(new Blob([await pdf.save()],{type:'application/pdf'}),'toolora-processed.pdf');setMsg('PDF processed locally.')}}}catch(e){setMsg('The file could not be processed. Check its type and size.')}finally{setBusy(false)}};return <div style={{marginTop:28}}>{tool.type==='qr'&&<Field label="Text or URL" value={preview} onChange={e=>setPreview(e.target.value)} placeholder="https://example.com"/>}<label className="card" style={{display:'block',borderStyle:'dashed',textAlign:'center',padding:36}}><Upload size={30}/><h3>Select files</h3><p className="muted">Processed locally whenever supported.</p><input type="file" multiple={tool.id==='pdf-merge'||tool.id==='zip-creator'} onChange={e=>setFiles([...e.target.files||[]])}/></label>{files.length>0&&<p className="muted">{files.map(f=>f.name).join(', ')}</p>}<div className="actions"><button className="btn primary" disabled={busy||(!files.length&&tool.type!=='qr')} onClick={handle}>{busy?'Processing…':'Process locally'}</button></div>{msg&&<div className="result">{msg}</div>}<div className="notice">Your files are processed locally in your browser whenever possible. This frontend does not upload them.</div></div>}
